fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#gst_log_context_builder_set_hash_flags","fragment":"\n\tgst_log_context_builder_set_hash_flags\n\nSets the hash flags for the log context being built. These determine how\nmessage hashes are calculated for determining duplicates.\nParameters:\na GstLogContextBuilder\nthe hash flags to use for the log context\nthe same GstLogContextBuilder\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});